## Project Overview
This is a Chinese website based on Next.js. It is a cloud computing power platform. It mainly includes two products: GPU container service and Model API service. The website contains multiple product display pages, product console, LLM API Playground (an AI Chatbot), Image API Playground (a series of AI image generation applications), and supporting functions (billing center, account settings, etc.).

## Tech Stack
- ReactJS
- Next.JS
- Webpack
- Typescript
- TailwindCSS
- Shadcn/UI
- SASS

## General Development Principles
- DRY（Don't Repeat Yourself）
- SOLID
- KISS (Keep It Simple, Stupid)
- YAGNI (You Ain't Gonna Need It)
- POLA (Principle of Least Astonishment)
- LoD (Law of Demeter)
- SoC (Separation of Concerns)
- High Cohesion, Loose Coupling
